{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["OVERMAN King Gainer","In the distant future, mankind is forced to live in domed cities called Domepolis after an environmental cataclysm. These cities are maintained and supplied by private corporations, but at what cost to the inhabitants living within them? In a Siberian Domepolis, virtual game champion Gainer Sanga is arrested on suspicion of Exodus, an unauthorized venture beyond the dome walls and strictly prohibited by the government.\n\n\n\nIn prison, he meets Gain Bijou, a mercenary bent on escaping and together the two will steal a mysterious Overman out of Duke Medaiyu's mansion. Fighting back the Siberian Railway Patrol forces, they both lead a massive Exodus out of the city to the east land Yapan, where their ancestors are originally from.\n\n\n\n(Source: Bandai Entertainment)"],"ja":["OVERMANキングゲイナー",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1792","ids":{"shikimori":1792,"mal":1792,"anilist":1792,"kodik":"serial-25489"},"kodikIds":["serial-25463","serial-25489"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-25463":"2020-05-06T02:07:26Z","serial-25489":"2020-05-07T05:55:18Z"},"title":"Король Гэйнер","originalTitle":"Overman King Gainer","alt":"オーバーマン キングゲイナー OVERMANキングゲイナー","description":"В далёком будущем человечеству пришлось укрыться под куполами городов, пока остальной мир восстанавливается после многолетних экологических катастроф. В сибирском Доме-полисе профессиональный геймер Гэйнер Санга и наёмник Гэйн Бидзё захватывают Оверман и возглавляют массовый исход жителей из города.","year":2002,"type":"TV","genres":["Приключения","Фантастика","меха"],"rating":7.06,"popularity":6547,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1792/95755568053f482f53e1d8d129508886.jpeg","width":710,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1792-KPk9ZaWxL1Eh.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9,